   "instrument_id": "EO:6684F",
   "outcome": "blocked",
   "reason": "[\"No attributed held text of this order is located; the only evidence is a 1944 WPA list entry reading 'Code of Fair Competition for the Barber Shop Trade conditionally approved', and the census register holds no title, signer or text.\",\"No clause inventory exists; the conditions of the conditional approval are unknown, so no own-terms end, independent command or scope can be assessed.\"]"
  },
  {
   "instrument_id": "EO:6725A",
   "outcome": "blocked",
   "reason": "[\"Condition 1 stays the waiting-period provisions of Article VII, Section 1, paragraph (c) 'pending my further order either within a period of sixty days from the effective date of this Code or after the completion of a study of open price associations'; the end event is alternative and contingent and the code's effective date is itself affected by held EO 6743 (June 16, 1934, stay of the code's effective date until July 9, 1934), which the dossier does not register as evidence; no further order ending this stay is held.\",\"Condition 2 stays Article VII, Section 6 'pending my further order'; held EO 6743 eliminates that stay on June 16, 1934, an ending the dossier does not register as evidence.\",\"The direction that the Code Authority investigate and report within ninety days, with provisions subject to modification afterwards, is an independent report direction: a report date is a deadline and not an end, held EO 6743 extends the report date to November 15, 1934, and no held record shows the report made or the modification decided.\"]"
  },
