   "instrument_id": "EO:6837",
   "outcome": "blocked",
   "reason": "[\"EO 6837 amends only the seventh paragraph of Article I of the automobile code, moving the expiration date from September 4, 1934 to November 5, 1934, 'effective immediately'. Held EO 6895 (November 2, 1934) amends the same paragraph, 'effective immediately', so the wording this order enacted was replaced on November 2, 1934 and the first end of this clause is that replacement, not the June 14, 1935 repeal.\",\"EO 6895 recites the prior wording as November 3, 1934, whereas this order's held text states November 5, 1934; the discrepancy is unresolved between two APP transcriptions. EO 6895's only held text is a Wayback-only capture, and the dossier registers no evidence id for it as an ending instrument, so the ending cannot be cited.\"]"
  },
  {
   "instrument_id": "EO:6895",
