   "reason": "[\"The only registered text of EO 6895 is an American Presidency Project page whose mirror record names the Wayback Machine as its capture archive; a Wayback-only APP capture fails offline custody and no other registered text is held.\",\"EO 6895 amends only the seventh paragraph of Article I of the automobile code (expiration date February 1, 1935). Held EO 6955 (January 31, 1935) replaces that paragraph, 'effective immediately', so the first end of this clause would be January 31, 1935; the dossier registers no evidence id for EO 6955, so the ending cannot be cited.\"]"
